# oracle: fix indent sphere with a moving centre (variable v_y, equal-style, evaluated each step) on an LJ sc solid in SI units,
# the geometry and force constant of examples/bpm/peri (in.bpm.peri.pmb) with a plain lj/cut pair in place of bpm/peri (not
# in this engine). Atoms that leave the fixed box are counted by thermo_modify lost ignore (3486, 3482, 3478 atoms at steps 7, 15, 24).
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units si
dimension 3
boundary f f f
atom_style atomic
atom_modify map array
lattice sc 0.0005
region box block -0.006 0.006 -0.006 0.002 -0.006 0.006 units box
create_box 1 box
region target cylinder y 0.0 0.0 0.0050 -0.0050 0.0 units box
create_atoms 1 region target
mass * 2.75e-7
pair_style lj/cut 0.0015001
pair_coeff * * 1.0e-9 0.0005
velocity all set 0.0 0.0 0.0 sum no units box
fix 1 all nve
variable y0 equal 0.00155
variable vy equal -100
variable y equal "v_y0 + step*dt*v_vy"
fix 2 all indent 1e17 sphere 0.0000 v_y 0.0000 0.0015 units box
timestep 1.0e-7
thermo_style custom step atoms pe ke
thermo_modify format float %.15g lost ignore
thermo 1
run 30
